Since \(x, y, z\) are positive integers and \(x \leq y \leq z\), \(xyz\) must divide 4024. The prime factorization of 4024 is \(2^3 \cdot 503\). Thus, \(xyz\) can be one of the divisors of 4024.

Considering \(x = 1\), we substitute into the equation:
