\[ x + \left(-\frac{\sqrt{3} \cdot x}{x - 1}\right)(x - 1) - \sqrt{x^2 + \left(-\frac{\sqrt{3} \cdot x}{x - 1}\right)^2 (x - 1)^2} \]

